<title>SPAIN: Workers at Petronor Bilbao refinery to strike.</title>
<headline>Workers at Petronor Bilbao refinery to strike.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Workers at Petronor's refinery near Bilbao will go on strike between November 16 and 25, shutting production at the 200,000 barrels per day plant, a refinery spokesman said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The strike is the latest in a series of protests since March. Unions and management have so far failed to strike a wage agreement.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
